Personal Budget Calculator
About the Project

This is my first Python programming project. I created a simple Personal Budget Calculator to practise basic Python programming and understand how to manage monthly income and expenses.

Features
Displays monthly income.
Calculates total monthly expenses.
Shows monthly savings.
Calculates the remaining money.
Technologies Used
Python 3
Visual Studio Code
Example

Monthly income: €1,000

Rent: €400
Food: €150
Transport: €65
Other expenses: €70
Savings: €315

Total expenses: €685

Remaining money: €0

What I Learned
Using Python variables.
Adding numbers.
Performing calculations.
Displaying information using print().
Organising a simple Python project.
